### NOTES ###
# Vite only exposes env vars prefixed with VITE_* to client code. Read them in app code via `import.meta.env.VITE_*`.
# NODE_ENV is set by Vite itself per command (dev / build) — don't set it here.
# In app code, use `import.meta.env.MODE` / `.DEV` / `.PROD` instead.
# Vite supports importing properties from the package json like `import { version } from "../package.json"`
# Never add a secret to an .env when `ssr: false`

